{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"X\",\n    \"small\": \"Y\",\n    \"core\": \"Y\",\n    \"concise\": \"平\",\n    \"human\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：X 的大块直接交代离开、拒签、提出异议、复核到最终结算，单看大字就能明白事件及其发展；Y 的大字主要是情绪短语，关键因果关系留在小字里。load：Y 放大的文字更短、更容易扫读，X 在 S10—S12 等短停留屏幕上连续出现多个较长大块，阅读负担偏重。small：Y 的小字更经常补出怀念、委屈、孤独之间的细微转折，与话的内容衔接较好；fine：X 更胜一筹，像「胸口发紧、伸手只摸到空处」「后颈一凉、脉搏乱跳」这样的感受具体且有辨识度，Y 有不少小字转向描述音乐或解释情绪。core：Y 更准确地表现了不愿再受委屈、又舍不得旧日亲近与归属的反复拉扯，结尾也形成了带着怀念继续生活、不再牺牲尊严的选择；X 的法律程序和住房处置占据较多篇幅，容易让核心偏向产权与补偿问题。human：Y 整体更接近日常说话，X 的「转入正式复核」「产权份额和非自愿搬离记录」等表达有较明显的行政材料腔。concise：判平，X 重复暂住和等待处理的状态，但程序确实在推进；Y 多次回到怀念亲近与不愿忍受委屈，也有新的心理角度，双方都有一定重复。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f65cc05c-87f9-453b-8cfc-e66a37e0341a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T182055018351Z", "elapsed_seconds": 145.625, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T18:23:20.662002+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "75ac51d91ff2d6cbdcd4d6af6d8a36f8a7e867dbe5d25bb3a352d200451f0404", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_co